Open Dominant Script On Scene Change\" is enabled, the current scene's script _isn't_ moved to the top _unless_ \"Sort Scripts By\" is set to \"None\". In other words, setting it to \"Name\" or \"Path\" doesn't result in the same re-ordering issue.\n\nSo this seems like a problem with \"Open Dominant Script On Scene Change\", where it moves the current scene's script to the top of the list when automatic ordering is disabled. Whereas I believe the expected behaviour is that when automatic ordering is disabled, \"Open Dominant Script On Scene Change\" should just open the script _without_ moving it to the top (same as it does when automatic ordering is enabled).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3930838262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4937372154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116472#issuecomment-4937372154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116472","id":4937372154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJkpR-g","user":{"login":"mr-dreich","id":23221964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjIxOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23221964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mr-dreich","html_url":"https://github.com/mr-dreich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mr-dreich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mr-dreich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mr-dreich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mr-dreich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mr-dreich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mr-dreich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mr-dreich/repo